    </codeType>
    <description>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "Layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWhere trees are proposed adjacent to footways, cycleways, or shared surfaces, their placement \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Enot obstruct existing or proposed street lighting, CCTV, or other above-or below-ground services (including cables and pipes). This \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Einclude ensuring that: \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cul\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ea minimum distance of 5 metres from the tree centre to any lighting column, CCTV unit, or major utility \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Ebe provided, unless it can be clearly demonstrated that the mature canopy and root system of the selected species will not cause interference \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Etrees have a minimum clear stem height of 1.8 metres at planting to maintain visibility at eye level \u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003Ewhere site constraints limit space or sightlines, a narrow (fastigiate) species \u003Cstrong\u003Emust \u003C/strong\u003Ebe selected to minimise canopy spread and maintain clear views\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/li\u003E\u003C/ul\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </description>
    <developmentScales>
